abstract: >-
  English short edition and executive summary presenting the high-level
  architecture, product direction, selected internal results, and observed
  limitations of a proprietary causal-world runtime project. The complete
  technical dossier is currently available in French; this is not a full
  English translation. No engine source code, implementation recipes,
  configurations, or raw data are included.
